sequenceDiagram
    %% SD1 - Sign up and subscribe
    %% Stories: 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8
    %% Description: A customer opens an account, adds personal and banking details, chooses a membership type, and later extends the subscription or unsubscribes.
    actor CP as Customer (person)
    participant CU as Customer
    participant PI as PaymentInformation
    participant SB as Subscription

    %% covers 1, 2, 7
    CP->>CU: open account with personal information
    %% covers 3
    CP->>CU: add banking details
    CU->>PI: payment information
    %% covers 4
    CP->>CU: choose membership type
    CU->>SB: subscription
    %% covers 6
    CP->>CU: check how long the subscription lasts
    %% covers 5
    CP->>CU: extend subscription
    %% covers 8
    CP->>CU: unsubscribe
